      "prompt": "I want to build a Shopify app that recovers failed payments — when a customer's card is declined, it sends automated recovery flows. The market has a few players but none focused on the Nordics.",
      "expected_output": "Two-stage output: assumption inversions (e.g. what if the problem isn't recovery but prevention), cross-domain analogies from non-fintech domains, synthesis matrix",
      "files": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "prompt": "I'm running a clinical trials directory site built with programmatic SEO. The data pipeline uses SCD2 (slowly changing dimensions type 2) to track how trials evolve over time. I want to grow this into something more than just a directory.",
      "expected_output": "Two-stage output: assumption inversions (e.g. what if the value isn't the directory but the change history), cross-domain analogies leveraging the temporal data asset, synthesis matrix",
      "files": []
    }
  ]
}

